    "UIName": "QueenBee LAM QNB-A",
    "Id": "mechdef_queenbee_lam_QNB-A",
    "Name": "QueenBee LAM QNB-A",
    "Details": "We here at QuicSell saw the opportunity to make every Mechwarrior into royalty, with our new Queenbee LAM. Faster than those proletarian Bug 'Mechs, this Queenbee packs a powerful sting, with a pair of Medium Chem Lasers and a Small Chem laser, as well as a modest bomb bay. It may be modest, but packed in that bomb bay, your opportunity to 'Release the Hive!'(tm) with our Firecracker rockets. And if that's not enough, the Queenbee comes equipped with our classic Hardwood structure, enabling anyone to do structural repairs to their mech in even the worst technological conditions!\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Land Air Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>",
    "Icon": "StingerLAM"
  },
